-
-      Conformance: Create a controlled new name.
-
-
-0249. Make uniqueness precondition
-
-      The Function-22 FCB shall name a file that does not already exist;
-      the caller is responsible for preventing duplicates.
-
-      Disposition: REQUIRED
-
-      Evidence:    IG; I011; I030; I031.
-
-      Conformance: Baseline tests use an absent exact name.
-
-
-0250. New empty file
-
-      Successful Make shall create a zero-record file under the supplied
-      valid FCB identity.
-
-      Disposition: REQUIRED
-
-      Evidence:    IG; I011; I030; I031.
-
-      Conformance: Search the name and inspect RC=0.
-
-
-0251. Make activates FCB
-
-      Successful Make shall initialize and activate the caller FCB for
-      subsequent I/O without Function 15.
-
-      Disposition: REQUIRED
-
-      Evidence:    IG; I011; I030; I031.
-
-      Conformance: Call Function 21 immediately.
-
-
-0252. Make success result
-
-      Successful Make shall return a directory code 0-3 in A.
-
-      Disposition: REQUIRED
-
-      Evidence:    IG; I011; I030; I031.
-
