+069 - CP/M 2.2 Compatibility Ledger Integrity Resolution
+
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------
+
+Investigation 069 produced the canonical ledger by removing the second
+verbatim 0248-0277 block, explicitly cross-referencing the overlapping
+Function-37 policy scopes at 0435 and 0523, and assigning canonical
+identifiers 0623-0627 to the processor propositions evidenced by I063.
+
+The resulting numbered proposition sequence is contiguous and unique.
+No existing required proposition or evidence history was removed. The
+source catalogue was extended through I069. Detailed before/after and
+disposition audits are preserved in the Investigation 069 artifacts.
